### Code Snippets

```
p {
border: 1px solid black;
padding: 5px;
}
p.ex1 {
outline-style: solid;
outline-color: red;
}
p.ex2 {
outline-style: dotted;
outline-color: blue;
}
p.ex3 {
outline-style: outset;
outline-color: 
  green;
}
p.ex4 {
outline-style: solid;
outline-color: invert;
}

---

p.ex1 {
outline-style: solid;
outline-color: #ff0000; 
  /* red */
}

---

p.ex1 {
outline-style: solid;
outline-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); /* 
  red */
}

---

p.ex1 {
outline-style: solid;
outline-color: hsl(0, 100%, 50%); 
  /* red */
}
```
